{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c06428e2d7bfc92b665544dbf888296194b619af5f496e4e504acbf0e4db6d5",
      "text": "速食甜点广告拍摄的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d40a237ebe305e3c144344ba754416edc85068fcf5beb04570fcb93e5669ca8d",
      "text": "为了今天的广告拍摄，我用拿到的样品\n试着做了一下点心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0fb6578a08c6054c90c41d7f74ec9f72733ffd693a6db7f5bfd443d9e5a415",
      "text": "我分别用热水和牛奶做了两种，\n做出来的味道都很不错哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317c970e42e0eda8da13d6835c1a436a5154aba09a4d2b19e5dee2c07cf34c6c",
      "text": "好想快点做给事务所的大家尝尝啊！\n啊，当然还有●●●●プロデューサー也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07ad3590a1854a90523255c717a3e806b99e069020fba2120ea8649541549c6a",
      "text": "这款商品我也一直很在意，\n务必请让我尝一尝呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:624fcc66642330fd9467040992533338e4a20f06dc58f0a3757ba80c601b66ae",
      "text": "那等发售之后，我就做给\n●●●●プロデューサー和大家吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dba9b3f4d2922b077459117534369686285e746c0424bb0a1559b81f6b5fb53",
      "text": "听凉先生这么一说，\n我也想亲手做做看那款点心了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:775f71fc070691ad79cd2e5d5f79c1ef728d4da4fc4bcb618d77859470ed27ee",
      "text": "不如我们两个人一起做，\n然后再拿去给事务所的大家吃怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e14c84c7eabd25a8b66427fcdc4a4ab74b209b8f48791ca287fff47c445a53b",
      "text": "包装上写着\n似乎还可以做各种各样的改编做法呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2acf452b93a3467cab76b1f9c1cb2a2e01c7cd2866394a611c0c8abba6a35293",
      "text": "好主意！\n等商品发售后我们就试试看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_041ryo_1_5_041_03:1_5_041_03:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6050af36a06d94b3618d7e1910f8785a5bdfaf785aeae5a76149cd3a4b36329f",
      "text": "好的！在那之前，拍摄时我也要做出\n美味的点心来！我出发啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
